### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Stats
GET http://localhost:4000/api/stats

### Donations
GET http://localhost:4000/api/donations?limit=10

### Top donors
GET http://localhost:4000/api/donors/top?limit=5

### Milestones
GET http://localhost:4000/api/milestones

### Milestone metadata
GET http://localhost:4000/api/milestones/0/metadata

### Upsert metadata
PUT http://localhost:4000/api/milestones/0/metadata
Content-Type: application/json

{ "receiptUrl": "https://example.com/receipt.pdf", "notes": "Invoice #123" }
